@rtribotte yes, it only started after the last update to v3.4.3. I can't tell for sure if I was on 3.4.1 before, but I use new image versions as soon as they're available. So probably, yes.

As you can see in my configuration I don't use HTTP3. 

I noticed in the debug logs that still used a [deprecated label](https://doc.traefik.io/traefik/migration/v3/#v322) for `traefik.docker.network` instead of `traefik.swarm.network` and changed it today. Since then the service kept running without any problems, but it's probably unrelated.

Hey there,

@reporter @participant9 @participant4 could you provide us with more feedback, please?
Has the variable fixed the issue?
